    {
        "user": "U06QAS7FPUH",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1771619465.910109",
        "client_msg_id": "af716cdc-2b50-4d3e-986f-b78a3a4cba88",
        "text": "I think it is too much talk, and focused only on themes. I like clear and short emails with these kind of change logs. Example below. \n\n​Hi everyone,\n\n​We’ve just released a major update to MindTrajour! We completed a full infrastructure modernization behind the scenes to make the platform faster and more reliable, while also rolling out several everyday usability improvements based on your feedback.\n\n​Here is what’s new and improved:\n- ​Themes &amp; Visual Polish: We've refined the interface for better readability and accessibility. Also added theme options which you can easily select on app sidebar. If you miss the classic look, we’ve added a \"MindTrajour Original\" theme so you can easily switch back!\n- ​Faster &amp; More Reliable: Upgraded our core framework for better stability and faster performance across the board.\n- ​Safer Trade Entry: Saving button clearly indicates the process to prevent accidental duplicate trade creation\n- ​Seamless Account Switching: Fixed an issue so your All Trades view now refreshes correctly when changing accounts.\n- ​Safari Compatibility: Resolved monthly chart month sorting issues for Safari browser users.\n\n​We want to say a huge thank you for the detailed feedback we’ve received. Your ideas and real-world use cases are our biggest motivation to keep improving MindTrajour.\n​All updates are live now. If anything feels off, or if you want to let us know which theme you enjoy most, just reply directly to this email!\n\n​Best,\nThe MindTrajour Team",
        "team": "T0197SMV2MQ",
        "user_team": "T0197SMV2MQ",
        "source_team": "T0197SMV2MQ",
        "user_profile": {
            "avatar_hash": "e6c03bfa2940",
            "image_72": "https:\/\/avatars.slack-edge.com\/2024-03-17\/6814162374787_e6c03bfa29409aabbabf_72.jpg",
            "first_name": "Enes",
            "real_name": "Enes Zorlu",
            "display_name": "Enes Zorlu",
            "team": "T0197SMV2MQ",
            "name": "enes.zrl",
            "is_restricted": false,
            "is_ultra_restricted": false
        },
        "thread_ts": "1771611131.821229",
        "parent_user_id": "U05BP6JEKRD",
        "blocks": [
