                        "type": "rich_text_section",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "I think it is too much talk, and focused only on themes. I like clear and short emails with these kind of change logs. Example below. \n\n​Hi everyone,\n\n​We’ve just released a major update to MindTrajour! We completed a full infrastructure modernization behind the scenes to make the platform faster and more reliable, while also rolling out several everyday usability improvements based on your feedback.\n\n​Here is what’s new and improved:\n- ​Themes & Visual Polish: We've refined the interface for better readability and accessibility. Also added theme options which you can easily select on app sidebar. If you miss the classic look, we’ve added a \"MindTrajour Original\" theme so you can easily switch back!\n- ​Faster & More Reliable: Upgraded our core framework for better stability and faster performance across the board.\n- ​Safer Trade Entry: Saving button clearly indicates the process to prevent accidental duplicate trade creation\n- ​Seamless Account Switching: Fixed an issue so your All Trades view now refreshes correctly when changing accounts.\n- ​Safari Compatibility: Resolved monthly chart month sorting issues for Safari browser users.\n\n​We want to say a huge thank you for the detailed feedback we’ve received. Your ideas and real-world use cases are our biggest motivation to keep improving MindTrajour.\n​All updates are live now. If anything feels off, or if you want to let us know which theme you enjoy most, just reply directly to this email!\n\n​Best,\nThe MindTrajour Team"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
